    "Id": "chassisdef_ionraptor_ION-2R",
    "Name": "Ion Raptor",
    "Details": "One of the Vining Engineering and Salvage Team’s more curious creations, the Ion Raptor is a hand built marque of battlemechs built with salvaged mech chassis's from the Clan front lines. First debuting in 3053, the original Ion Raptor was built from the remains of a Masakari and a Crab. Built specifically for the Solaris Arenas, less than a dozen Ion Raptors are known to exist, though speculation is rife that VEST intends to sell the design to a major manufacturer in the near future. The ION-2R is the standard model offered by VEST and the most well known one. 4 Medium Pulse Lasers and 4 Streak-4’s form the bulk of the Mechs armament, with a pair of Large Lasers providing a ranged punch. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.1</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
